# {{module}}

An [Airway](https://github.com/daqing/airway) site theme, scaffolded with
`airway theme:new`. Implements `github.com/daqing/airway/lib/ssg.Theme`:
templ components for the layout plus embedded static assets, consumed by
Airway static showcase sites as a Go module dependency.

## Page data types

| Type | Renders |
|---|---|
| `{{package}}.Home` | landing page: hero heading + tagline |
| `{{package}}.Content` | text page: title, lead, paragraphs |
| `templ.Component` | custom body inside the shared layout |
| anything else | header and footer only |

Edit `theme.go` (data types and dispatch) and `theme.templ` (components),
then regenerate and test:

```bash
go generate ./...   # regenerate the templ views (generated files are committed)
go test ./...
```

## Using the theme in a site

From a site project (see
[docs/ssg.md](https://github.com/daqing/airway/blob/main/docs/ssg.md)):

```bash
airway theme:install {{module}}
```

Then select it in the site's `ssg.go` with `s.Use({{package}}.Theme)`.
